    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE FULL VERSION</h1><p></p><br><h1>CHECK OUT TOY TINKER SIMULATOR</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1658935778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Animal Rescuer: Prologue is a free standalone version of the game Animal Rescuer, featuring the initial part of the story. Our hero is helping lovely animals through exploring an epic world with faster gameplay and increased quest and combat intensity.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in a great roleplaying experience \u2013 achieve quests and complete objectives of the entire story</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Acquire plants to prepare medicine for lovely animals needing help</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet new people along the way through fantastic cities and villages of this world</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Demonstrate warrior abilities in epic combats with enemies and bosses</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.poster.avif?t=1658935778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.webm?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.mp4?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/2223096e2d1af7023a8becb484e44080.avif?t=1658935778\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1658935778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Animal Rescuer: Prologue is a free standalone version of the game Animal Rescuer, featuring the initial part of the story. Our hero is helping lovely animals through exploring an epic world with faster gameplay and increased quest and combat intensity.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in a great roleplaying experience \u2013 achieve quests and complete objectives of the entire story</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Acquire plants to prepare medicine for lovely animals needing help</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet new people along the way through fantastic cities and villages of this world</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Demonstrate warrior abilities in epic combats with enemies and bosses</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.poster.avif?t=1658935778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.webm?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/9ca3d4771e2be0e6f6ae9ed724bb9f92.mp4?t=1658935778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428610/extras/2223096e2d1af7023a8becb484e44080.avif?t=1658935778\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Animal Rescuer: Prologue is a free standalone version of the game Animal Rescuer, featuring the initial part of the story. Our hero is helping lovely animals through exploring an epic world with faster gameplay and increased quest and combat intensity.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cTHE WITCHER OF PUPPIES AND KITTENS\u201d<br>8.3 \u2013 KeenGamer<br><br>\u201cAfter playing many girly games where I had to take care of horses or cure animals as a vet, I thought it would be a fun change of pace to play an action RPG that revolves around saving wildlife.\u201d<br>7.4 \u2013 ChristCenteredGamer<br><br>\u201cAnimal Rescuer is a gorgeous looking game about Rescuing Animals!\u201d<br>The Indie Game Reporter<br>",
